plain_text_password_found = data\config\himalaya.toml har yanzu yana ɗauke da kalmar sirri ta rubutu na fili (auth.raw) daga tsohon saitin asusu.\n\nCire wannan asusun ka sake ƙara shi, ko ka share data\config\himalaya.toml, domin ya sake samuwa ta amfani da amintaccen ma'ajiyar bayanan shaida.

