cache_clear_confirm = A share ma'ajiyar saƙonnin rashin intanet ta dukkan asusun?\n\nWannan yana share kwafin ZBox na cikin gida kawai. Ba a cire komai daga kowace sabar imel, kuma ana sake sauke saƙonni idan ka buƙace su.
account_remove_confirm = A cire {name} ({address})?\n\nBa a share wasiƙa a kan sabar ba.\nAna share kwafin da aka sauke zuwa wannan kwamfutar.\nAna share kalmar sirrin da aka adana.
folder_delete_confirm = A share babban fayil "{folder}" da duk abin da ke cikinsa na {address} har abada?\n\nBa za a iya warware wannan ba.
empty_trash_confirm = A share dukkan saƙonnin da ke shara na {address} har abada?\n\nBa za a iya warware wannan ba.
empty_junk_confirm = A share dukkan saƙonnin da ke saƙon banza na {address} har abada?\n\nBa za a iya warware wannan ba.
sync_select_account = Zaɓi asusu (ba babban fayil na haɗaka ba) da za a daidaita don amfani ba tare da intanet ba.
accounts_imported = An shigo da asusu {count}:\n\n{names}\n\nBa a taɓa fitar da kalmomin sirri, kuma ma'ajiyar kalmomin sirri da aka ɓoye ta keɓance ga wannan asusun mai amfani da Windows, don haka kowane asusu da aka shigo da shi yana buƙatar a shigar da kalmar sirrinsa sau ɗaya ta Kayan Aiki > Saitunan asusu da shaida kafin ya iya haɗawa.
accounts_import_none = Ba a sami asusu a cikin wannan fayil ɗin ba. An shigo da saituna ko da yake, idan fayil ɗin yana da su.
delete_permanently_confirm_one = A share wannan saƙon har abada? Wannan yana tsallake babban fayil na shara kuma ba za a iya warware shi ba.
accounts_locked = An rubuta kalmomin sirrin asusu da aka adana a wata kwamfuta, don haka ba za a iya karanta su a nan ba.\n\nKowane asusu zai sake shiga sabar imel ɗinsa. Don guje wa hakan a gaba, saita babbar kalmar sirri daga Saituna, Tsaron manhaja da bayanai a kwamfutar da asusun ke aiki a yanzu.
master_password_remove_confirm = A cire babbar kalmar sirri? Za a iya karanta kalmomin sirrin asusu da aka adana a wannan kwamfutar da wannan asusun Windows kawai. Idan ka kwafi ZBox zuwa wani wuri daga baya, kowane asusu zai sake shiga.\n\nA cire ta yanzu?
shortcut_offer = A saka gajeriyar hanyar ZBox a tebur?\n\nTa fara wannan babban fayil na ZBox:\n{path}\n\nGajeriyar hanya tana tuna ainihin wannan wuri. Idan ka mayar da babban fayil na ZBox daga baya, buɗe Saituna, Tire na tsarin da taga, ka sake zaɓar Ƙirƙiri gajeriyar hanyar tebur don nuna sabon wurin.
shortcut_created = An ƙirƙiri gajeriyar hanya:\n{path}

