# The lock screen and the Unlock Methods dialog: its notes, the name
# a button takes when it is unavailable, and every status line.
unl_note_locked = ZBox a kulle yake. Yi amfani da kowace hanya daga cikin na ƙasa don buɗe shi. Soke yana rufe ZBox ba tare da buɗe kowane asusu ba.
unl_note_foreign_passkey = Maɓallin shiga da aka adana tare da wannan babban fayil na wata kwamfuta ne, don haka ba za a iya amfani da shi a nan ba. Buɗe da maɓallin tsaro ko babbar kalmar sirri, sannan ka yi amfani da Saituna, Sirri da tsaro, Hanyoyin buɗewa don saita maɓallin shiga a wannan kwamfutar.
unl_note_methods = Kowace ɗaya daga waɗannan tana buɗe ZBox idan kulle manhaja yana kunne, tare da babbar kalmar sirri. Maɓallin shiga yana amfani da Windows Hello a wannan kwamfutar; maɓallin tsaro maɓallin FIDO2 ne a USB ko NFC kuma yana aiki a kowace kwamfuta da ka toshe shi.
unl_note_not_encryption = Waɗannan suna buɗe manhajar. Ba sa ɓoye komai: babbar kalmar sirri har yanzu ita kaɗai ce za ta iya buɗe kalmomin sirrin asusu da aka adana a kwamfutar da ba a taɓa amfani da wannan babban fayil a kanta ba. Dole ne a saita ta tukuna, kuma babu ɗayansu da za a iya ƙarawa har sai an yi hakan.
