mp_explain_set = An saita babbar kalmar sirri. Ita ce ke ba wannan babban fayil na ZBox damar buɗe kalmomin sirrin asusunsa da aka adana a wata kwamfuta daban.\n\nBar akwatunan sabuwar kalmar sirri guda biyu fanko ka danna Ok don cire ta. Cire ta ba ya shafar wannan kwamfutar, amma babban fayil ɗin ba zai ƙara aiki a kowace wata ba tare da sake shigar da kowane asusu ba.
mp_explain_unset = Ba a saita babbar kalmar sirri ba, don haka ana iya karanta kalmomin sirrin asusu da aka adana a wannan kwamfutar da wannan asusun Windows kawai. Idan ka kwafi babban fayil zuwa wani wuri, kowane asusu zai sake shiga sabar imel ɗinsa.\n\nSaita ɗaya kuma ZBox zai nemi ta sau ɗaya a kowace sabuwar kwamfuta, sannan ya buɗe kamar yadda aka saba a can daga nan gaba. Wannan kwamfutar ba za ta sake tambaya ba.\n\nRubuta ta ka ajiye ta a wuri mai aminci. Ba a adana ta a ko'ina ba kuma ba za a iya maido ta ba: idan ka manta ta, kowane asusu zai sake shiga sabar imel ɗinsa.
