wiz_welcome_notice = Gmail. Za a ƙi kalmar sirrin Google ɗinka ta yau da kullum, amma kalmar sirrin manhaja tana aiki. Dole ne a kunna tabbatarwa matakai biyu tukuna. Maɓallin da ke ƙasa yana buɗe umarnin Google.\n\nOutlook.com, Hotmail, Live da Microsoft 365. Waɗannan suna shiga da asusunka na Microsoft. A shafin Shiga, zaɓi Asusun Microsoft, sannan ka shiga da burauzarka ko da lamba.\n\nSauran masu ba da sabis. Kalmar sirri ta yau da kullum ko kalmar sirrin manhaja yawanci tana aiki, kuma shafukan taimakon mai ba ka sabis suna lissafa saitunan sabar.
