shortcut_failed_startup = Ba a iya ƙirƙirar gajeriyar hanyar tebur ba:\n\n{error}\n\nZBox zai ci gaba da farawa. Za ka iya sake gwadawa daga baya daga Saituna.
account_locked_action = ZBox ba zai iya %s ba. Ba a iya buɗe jerin asusun a wannan zaman ba (%s), kuma ba a canza komai ba. Rufe ZBox ka sake kunna shi, ka shigar da babbar kalmar sirri idan aka nemi hakan.
send_tls_mismatch = Ba a iya aika saƙon ba. Sabar fita ta amsa ba tare da ɓoyewa ba, don haka ɓoyewar fita ba ta dace da tashar ba. A Kayan Aiki, Saitunan asusu da shaida, yi amfani da STARTTLS don tashar 587, ko SSL/TLS don tashar 465, sannan ka sake aikawa.\n\n{error}
mark_folder_read_failed = Ba a iya yi wa babban fayil alama a matsayin an karanta ba.\n\n{error}
update_failed = Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar ba, don haka ba a canza komai ba.\n\n{error}
update_rolled_back = Sabuntawar ta kasa farawa, don haka an maido da sigar da ta gabata.
attachment_open_failed = Ba a iya buɗe abin da aka haɗa ba.\n\n{error}
headers_failed = Ba a iya loda kanun saƙo ba.\n\n{error}
wizard_ms_sign_in_first = Shiga da Microsoft kafin ci gaba. Yi amfani da ɗaya daga maɓallan shiga biyu da ke wannan shafi.
wizard_provider_unsupported = ZBox ba zai iya shiga wurin wannan mai ba da sabis ba. Bayanin da ke wannan shafi yana bayyana dalili. Koma baya ka yi amfani da wani adireshin imel, ko ka soke.
acct_ms_sign_in_first = Shiga da Microsoft kafin adanawa, ko ka zaɓi Kalmar sirri a matsayin hanyar shiga.
ms_sign_in_again = Ana buƙatar shiga ta Microsoft don {account} kuma. Buɗe Saitunan asusu da shaida ka shiga a can.
graph_pgp_too_large = Wannan saƙon da aka ɓoye ko aka sa wa hannu ya fi abin da Microsoft ke ba da izini ga irin wannan wasiƙa girma, kusan MB 3. Aika ƙananan abubuwan da aka haɗa, ko ka kashe Ɓoye bayanai da Sa hannu ta lambobi don wannan saƙon.
